Package: FDRS
Type: Project
Title: Fabrication-risk Digit Randomness Screening Framework
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhuohua", "Cao", email = "1247166997cc@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Hanyong", "Jin", role = "aut")
)
Description: A statistical and machine-learning-assisted framework for screening non-random decimal digit-pattern irregularities in raw numerical research data. The framework includes single-digit tests, joint digit-combination analysis, progressive subsampling, feature engineering, semi-supervised machine-learning risk scoring, and visualization. It is intended for screening and prioritization only, not as standalone evidence of fabrication or misconduct.
